---
import Layout from "../Layout/Layout.astro"
import AstraPic from "../assets/Astra.jpg"
import CharliPic from "../assets/Charli.jpg"
import { Image } from "astro:assets"
---


<Layout title="About">
    <div class="bg" />
    <div class="u-container">
        <div class="Column-personal">
            <div class="Profile">
                <Image src={AstraPic} class="Profile-Photo" alt="Astra Photo" fetchpriority="high"/>
                <h1 class="Name" data-sy-reveal="words">Knapp</h1>
                <p class="Profile-Bio" data-sy-reveal="lines">A student at Junipero Serra High School, in their senior year. Has taken part in many different clubs and activities at serra, including Robotics, Mock Trial, Ethics Bowl and Track and Field.</p>
                <span class="spacer"/>
                <p class="Profile-Bio">
                    Throughout my time at Serra, the ideals of care and health have been discussed greatly. Doing activities like the Junior Urban Plunge has shown me the value of caring for those in need. Additionally, I’ve participated in Ethics Bowl, in which I discussed many moral issues.
                </p>
                <span class="spacer"/>
                <p class="Profile-Bio">I care because I know many people that are affected by this issue. I’ve seen the suffering caused by this injustice, and have great sympathy for those affected. The harm that is caused to trans people goes further than just trans people, as it affects many other queer people too.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="Profile">
                <Image src={CharliPic} class="Profile-Photo" alt="Chali Photo" fetchpriority="high"/>
                <h1 class="Name" data-sy-reveal="words">Huang</h1>
                <p class="Profile-Bio" data-sy-reveal="lines">Senior at Junipero Serra High School. </p>
                <span class="spacer"></span>
                <p class="Profile-Bio" data-sy-reveal="lines">
                    I’ve spent lots of time volunteering to help the marginalized and learning about virtues and ethics through classes at Serra. 
                    I’ve also written about issues adjacent to this through the Serra Friar as a freelancer reporter.
                    There are many close people in my life who are affected by the lack of healthcare, but also the general culture that supports harm toward transgender people. 
                    Already, they are made to feel worse about themselves for being who they are, and this increasing reduction in accessibility for healthcare makes it impossible for them to even work towards being themselves.</p>
                <span class="spacer"/>
                <p class="Profile-Bio">There are many close people in my life who are affected by the lack of healthcare, but also the general culture that supports harm toward transgender people. Already, they are made to feel worse about themselves for being who they are, and this increasing reduction in accessibility for healthcare makes it impossible for them to even work towards being themselves.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>

<style>
    .spacer {
        height: 10px;
    }
    .Column-personal {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: row;
        align-items: center;
        align-content: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 6rem 0 6rem;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        min-height: 100vh;
        text-align: center;
        max-height: 1000px;

    }
    .Name {
        max-width: 10em;
        line-height: 1;
        font-size: 2rem;
        align-self: center;
        align-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        text-align: justify;

    }
    .Profile {
        padding-left: 50px;
        padding-right: 50px;
        align-items: center;
        flex-direction: column;
        display: flex;
    }
    .Profile-Photo {
        height: 300px;
        width: 300px;
        z-index: 10;
        border-radius: 50%;
    }
    .Profile-Bio {
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: normal;
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 400px;
        //text-align-last: justify;
    }
</style>